*.bak-*

#---------------------------------------------
# Runtime artefacts generated on nodes
#---------------------------------------------

# LittleProxy auto-generates its MITM CA in the working directory the first time
# the BrowserUp recorder starts, so any node with recorder.enabled=true grows these
# two files and its checkout goes dirty -- which makes deploy.sh refuse to push.
# They are generated material, never source, and must not be deleted on a node:
# regenerating the CA invalidates the certificate the running browser profiles trust.
primemover-runner/littleproxy_cert
primemover-runner/littleproxy_keystore.jks

# Key material never belongs in git. The recorder CA (cert/2024/ca-cert.p12) is
# generated per installation with util/create-ca-keystore.sh and stays on the box.
*.p12
*.jks
*.key
*.pem

# The Anti-Captcha browser extension is third-party; download it, do not commit it (see README).
primemover-runner/anticaptcha/*.crx
primemover-runner/anticaptcha/*.crx_orig
primemover-runner/anticaptcha/*.xpi
